window.products.push({"id":990008,"name":"Bamjoy Over The Toilet Storage Shelf, Bamboo 3 Tier Bathroom Space Saver Organizer, Multipurpose Toilet Storage Rack with 6 Hooks Bathroom Kitchen Bal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vD8MGjpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【BAMBOO - ATTRACTIVE SHELF】 Made with 100% bamboo with smooth white finish to protect from scratching, the bathroom storage shelf is lovely, solid, sustainable and long lasting. A simple wet cloth for maintenance, the Space saver organizer could also be a very nice gift for your friends’ new house or apartment occupying little space but get away with those annoying clutter. Believe Bamjoy, this careful crafted shelf deserves your stop-by and purchase! 【MULTIFUNCTIONAL STORAGE RACK】More than over-the-toilet storage shelf, it can be used as kitchen display organizer with garbage can underneath, stable shelf for laundry, decent entryway stand for essential stuff or durable plant display collection shelf. By making full use of your idle space, Bamjoy designed this Over-the-Toilet Storage cabinet aiming to offer you an enjoyable and simple life! 【USEFUL DESIGN】 With the bottom height of 33Lx 10W inches, the Bathroom Space Saver Shelf fits over most standards toilets which create extra bathroom storage and tidiness. Also 3 open shelves are adjustable to store your bathroom essentials like toilet paper, towels, shampoos, books within a hand reach. And detachable 6 hooks for hanging some bathroom utilities like brushes, toilet tank cleaner, toiletries. Bamjoy Storage Organizer would be your first pick for limited space. 【STABLE CONSTRUCTION】PLEASE check carefuly the size before purchasing! Overall size of Bamjoy 3-Tier Over the Toilet Storage Rack is 25Lx 10Wx 64H Inches(64x 26x 163 cm). Secured with 2 set anti-tilt device to wall, the shelf is quite stable, no way of waggling or toppling over. Toilet Space - 33.3 Inches(84.5cm) from Ground to Lowest Shelf 【EASY TO PUT TOGETHER & SERVICE】 Straightforward instruction and hardware kit makes you confident and effortless. Just read and follow the direction step by step, putting them together is a piece of cake! Bamjoy’s Happy Service Team is always by your side offering you a happy shopping experience. Any problems, do not hesitate to reach out to us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vD8MGjpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bamjoy","source_asin":"B0B9HHR1JD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9HHR1JD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9HHR1JD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
