window.products.push({"id":990013,"name":"Ricdecor Christmas Garland for Mantle, Christmas Garland with Lights Battery Operated, Gold Ball and Leaves, 9 Feet Christmas Garland for Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"✅【Festive Appeal】The prelit Christmas garland is a delightful way to add instant Christmas spirit to any window frame, entryway, mantle, or other areas of the home. With 240 individually crafted branch tips, this Christmas garland with lights adds warmth and character. Opulent gold lit Christmas garland for a posh & glam look! ✅【Realistic and Bendable Garland】The individual branches of the Christmas garland mantle are posable, so you can position them any way you need to string lights or add accessories. You could also connect any numbers of strands to make it long enough. ✅【Lasting Durability】The outdoor Christmas garland is top quality and looks pretty authentic. The Christmas garland battery operated is durable and has not suffered any wear or tear at all in the strong wind, downpour rain, ice storm, and heavy snow. The lighted garland Christmas could last many holidays with it's time-tested, fire-resistant, and non-allergenic needles. ✅【Pre-lit Christmas Garland】The fireplace garland Christmas stretches 9 feet long and 12 inches wide. The Christmas garland for mantle is neatly trimmed with gold ball and leaves for a warm seasonal glow. Going with a gold Christmas garland almost brings a Narnia magical feel to your home. The garland Christmas lights a 32 Ft long 50 UL white LED string lights that long enough to wrap around the whole Christmas garland. ✅【Medium Thickness and Fluff】This mantle Christmas garland with 240 branch tips. You could stretch the branches out to create the fullness as it's wired and flexible. PLEASE NOTICE: The Christmas garlands clearance in the transport process may be flattened. Out of the box, it required a few minutes to straighten out folded branches. The greenery is bendable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ricdecor","source_asin":"B09BCN5873","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BCN5873","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BCN5873","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
