window.products.push({"id":990145,"name":"Anlyso Automatic Inductive Trash Can, Smart Waterproof Touchless Motion Sensor Waste Bin 14 Liter/3.7 Gallon Garbage Can with Lid for Kitchen Home Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rQF-KMLFS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Intelligent Kitchen Trash Can -- Made of high quality ABS and PP materials and infrared induction technology, this automatic garbage bin with lids will open automatically within 3 seconds in the sensor distance of 5-30cm and close within 5 seconds automatically after your hand leaves the sensing area. Besides the infrared motion sensor way, there are another three ways to open the lid, namely, knock Vibration induction, One-key switch the cover and Open the lid manually. Convenient and Unique Design -- with 4 setting way, You can not only close the lid of the trash can at any time to block the bad trash odor inside and keep the air of your home and office fresh, you can also keep the lid open all the time by setting the trash can manually when you are doing some cleaning. besides, with new inside slow-down device, The opening and closing of the dustbin lid are quite silent, providing you with quiet and comfortable life experience. Multipurpose Smart Trash Can -- Built in night light, the smart trash can will provide you with soft light at night. And featuring with advanced IPX5 waterproof technology, this trash can is perfect to be used in bathroom and can be easily cleaned with water. besides, with Proper size, wide and open top barrel as well as nice and modern design, it can also be used in kitchen, living room, office, etc, providing you a simple and elegant life Rechargable Sensoring Trash Bin -- Compared with other smart trash can powered by AA batteries, this Anlyso trash can is powered by USB cable(included), which is easier to use and will help save you much time and money to buy additional AA batteries for continuous use. and this rechargable battery can be used for several months after a single full charge What You Will Get -- 1*Automatic kitchen trash can, 1*USB Cable, 1*User Manual, 40-day unconditional refund or return and 24-hour friendly and professional customer service. Any problem after you receive this smart trash can, please feel free to contact us and we will try our best to meet your satisfactions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rQF-KMLFS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anlyso","source_asin":"B0912BDD8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912BDD8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912BDD8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
