window.products.push({"id":990418,"name":"SAJANDAS Artificial Succulent Plants in Gold Pots, Artificial Plant Cactus Succulent in Pots, Artificial Succulent Plants in Pots for Home Decor Indoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MArlROK8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Are you still sad about the withered leaves and petals? Have you always been too busy to take care of your plants? Do you want your room to be decorated with green plants at all times? So why not choose artificial plants? SAJANDAS selects different artificial succulent potted plants for you. You can place it in office, bookshelf, coffee table, windowsill, balcony, cabinet, foyer, so that your room is always decorated with green color. Keep them to break the monotony, spice up your office desk. Specifications: Material: PE Plants, Metal pot Color: Green Plants, Rose Gold Pots Product size: 6 * 6.5 cm, 6 * 10 cm, 6 * 13.5 cm Product weight: 60 g / piece Assembly Instructions: 1.Put the artificial plant into the middle of the sponge. 2.Spread evenly the white pebbles around each faux plant. 3.Please clean up the pot after the above actions. 4.Choose your favorite from all stickers and then you can style the pots. Tips: 1. Do not water the plants and do not place them in a humid environment. 2. Do not place the small potted plant in a place with high temperature, so as not to affect the gloss of the plant. Why choose SAJANDAS? SAJANDAS is committed to studying people's living habits. In order to make people's lives comfortable, they are constantly looking for things that can bring people happiness! Studies have shown that green everywhere can bring people continuous happiness, and can maintain a positive emotional output, thereby improving life happiness and work efficiency; therefore, SAJANDAS carefully selected the \"\"ambassador of spring\"\" for you, allowing you to be everywhere Spring is lively, stay happy! SAJANDAS-Best choice, Only for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MArlROK8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAJANDAS","source_asin":"B089M3HZ9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089M3HZ9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089M3HZ9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
