window.products.push({"id":990461,"name":"BRODARK Japanese Chef Knife,Professional Kitchen Knife in AUS-10 Steel, High-Class 8 Inch Chef's Knife with Ergonomic Handle, Ultra Sharp Cooking Knif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fCHz5elGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The birth of Kodaia: Our chef knife draws inspiration from the totems of the Wabanaki tribe, blending traditional motifs with modern design. More than just a kitchen tool, it embodies the spirit of courage and passion. We named it \"Kodaia,\" hoping it inspires confidence and joy in both novice and seasoned chefs. Let it ignite your creativity and love for cooking, and empower you to become bolder and more self-assured in the kitchen. Exquisite Craftsmanship: Our Japanese Chef Knife features the strongest AUS-10 steel from the AUS series, with a blade that has been heat-treated at 1050°C and nitrogen cooled, enhancing hardness, flexibility, and corrosion resistance for long-lasting sharpness and durability. The Pakka wood handle has been hand polished and layered for excellent grip and durability. Combined with a traditional Japanese round handle, it fits perfectly in your palm, and the unique brass and copper mosaic pin adds a subtle sense of luxury. Craftsmanship: The Professional Kitchen Knife is carefully crafted using the traditional Honbazuke method by skilled artisans in 3 steps, achieving a sharpness of 15° on each side of the blade for smooth and precise cutting. It boasts an impressive hardness of 62HRC, making it sharp enough to cut through various ingredients like butter. The ergonomic handle shape is designed for superior hand control, agility, and comfort. The tall blade height provides useful knuckle clearance for safe use every time. Safe cutting: The Kodaia series chef's knife is certified by the National Sanitation Foundation (NSF) and comes with a black protective sheath to ensure your safety and the knife's maintenance. Not only is this knife a reliable assistant in your kitchen, its beautifully designed packaging makes it the perfect gift for housewarmings, weddings, birthdays, Thanksgiving, and other holidays. The Kodaia series of knives represents the epitome of culinary excellence, allowing you to take full control of the cooking process After-sales service: We offer a rock-solid 100% satisfaction or refund guarantee for risk-free trial. We also provide a lifetime warranty to prevent any defects. BRODARK chef knife ensures that safety is no longer a concern when using the knife.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fCHz5elGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRODARK","source_asin":"B0BW8ZSWM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW8ZSWM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW8ZSWM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
