window.products.push({"id":990596,"name":"Clear Refrigerator Liners for Shelves Washable – 9 pc Customizable Washable Refrigerator Liners, Shelf Liners for Glass Shelves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EIF82NscS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEPS YOUR SURFACES CLEAN: Our washable shelf liners are designed to keep surfaces spotless. A non-adhesive design helps prevent dirt from sticking, making them very simple to use and clean. Easily wipe them clean, wash them in warm water and soap, or throw them in your dishwasher for easy cleaning. In addition to being easily cleaned, they are fast drying for added convenience. FULLY CUSTOMIZABLE: Fitting these refrigerator liners to any fridge is easy. They come in large standard size of 18 in x 12 in (45 cm x 30 cm), simply cut them to the required size of your refrigerator shelves or other surfaces and you are good to go. MADE OF PREMIUM GRADE MATERIALS: The Sunny Days Co fridge liners are made from high-quality Ethylene-Vinyl acetate. It is a high-quality food-grade polymer with rubber-like softness. Its non-toxic quality makes it safe when it comes into direct contact with your food. KEEPS THINGS NEAT AND TIDY: Add a touch of character to your regular refrigerator shelves. Thin as a paper and clear in color, these liners allows light to shine through the refrigerator shelf. The liners help keep things looking neat while adding a sense of life to your fridge, cabinets, and any storage space you place them in. PROTECTION FOR ALL YOUR SURFACES Convenient All-Purpose Use Our versatile washable shelf lining mats can be used in various areas around your home, not just the refrigerator. You can use them to line your kitchen drawers, cabinets, shelves, cupboards and so much more. They help create an anti-slip surface that prevents items made of glass from moving around. The mats can also be cut to any size and used to dress your countertops, desks, and bookshelves. They help create durable waterproof, oilproof, and dustproof protective layer over your surfaces. Buy the Sunny Days Co refrigerator liners and keep your refrigerator clean like you want it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EIF82NscS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunny Days Co","source_asin":"B08P554C5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P554C5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P554C5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
