window.products.push({"id":990619,"name":"Sauder Clifford Place L-Desk, L: 59.06\" x W: 53.54\" x H: 30.2\", Grand Walnut Finish & Harvey Park Narrow Bookcase, Grand Walnut Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kc-k9FvKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Sauder Clifford Place L-Desk, L: 59.06\" x W: 53.54\" x H: 30.2\", Grand Walnut FinishEnhance your home office or workspace with this l-shaped desk from the Clifford Place collection. Never run out of workspace – this mid-century inspired desk provides you with an abundance of tabletop space for all your office essentials like your laptop, important papers, notepads and much more! It features a slide out keyboard/mouse shelf that opens and closes on smooth metal runners. Storage is no issue with this desk! It includes three easy gliding storage drawers and two file drawers with full extension slides that accommodate letter-size hanging files. It also features cubbyhole storage for easy access storage of books, bins and folders. Its grommet holes and pass-throughs allow you to keep all your cords and wires neat and out of the way. The return can be fastened on to the left or right side to fit the needs of any room in your home. Finished on all sides in a warm Grand Walnut and accented with solid wood feet and bold brass hardware, this handsome desk will take your office space to a whole new level.Sauder Harvey Park Narrow Bookcase, Grand Walnut finishA little extra storage never hurts. Add some style and space to your home with this 3- shelf narrow bookcase from the Harvey Park® collection. This modern tall bookcase features two fixed shelves to store and display books, plants, décor and more! This contemporary bookshelf also features two file drawers with full extension slides to hold all your important letter, legal, or European size hanging files – talk about organization! An enclosed back with cord access ensures that this narrow bookcase with drawers can handle a small lamp, phone chargers, and more. Finished in Grand Walnut® with solid wood feet, this trendy bookcase with storage will look good in any room without taking up a lot of floor space. We hope you like what you see in this mid-century modern bookcase. Sauder designers travel the world and bring back the best and latest in style, finish, and color trends. This inspiring world travel is evident in the cutting edge and innovative furniture solutions we offer to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kc-k9FvKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B09YYL9QKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYL9QKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYL9QKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
