window.products.push({"id":990673,"name":"Elves Christmas Village - Animated Pre-lit Musical Santa’s Helpers Snow Village - North Pole Gift and Decor Elf Town - Perfect Addition to Your Christ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ppWlxo1KS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RESIN - This Animated Elves Christmas Village is made from high-quality resin materials and is meticulously hand-crafted and hand-painted by skilled artisans. This Realistic Christmas Village Figure is built to last and will be a treasured part of your Christmas Decorations for years to come. VERSATILE – Use this LED Lighted Musical Christmas Village Santa's Helpers as a centerpiece for your holiday displays or add it to your Snow Village Collection. It's a versatile Collectible Figurine that will add magic to any room. REALISTIC – This Pre Lit Christmas Village is so realistic that you'll feel like you're in a winter wonderland! Add this Light Up Snow Village to your indoor Christmas Decorations and create a magical holiday display. SPECIFICATIONS – The merry elves dance around the Christmas tree to the sound of 8 different Christmas songs. The consistent lighting adds a beautiful glow to the village when turned on. Santa's little helper peeks out from his red Santa hat, overseeing the scene, as two other elves gather around a freshly-made snowman. This Snow Village is operated with 3 x AA Battery (Not Included) & has a DC Jack Input (DC Adapter Not Included). Product size: 12.20 x 9.1 x 9.5 IN. MAKES A GREAT GIFT - Our exquisite Eleves Christmas Village is a thoughtful and memorable gift for your loved ones. Whether it's for a family member or friend, our Snow Village Figure is sure to bring joy and delight to any recipient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ppWlxo1KS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Top Treasures","source_asin":"B0BYJ57MTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYJ57MTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYJ57MTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":990674,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies Classics Dining with a King Figurine, 4.5 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AhfszsDEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"For over 27 years Department 56 artist, Kristi Jensen Pierro has captured the beauty and splendor of winter. Her personal experiences and interpretations of childhood are artfully designed into each Snowbabies' piece and carefully named to ensure a sentiment of love, friendship or inspiration. The new SnowDream collection is inspired by a winter walk in the woods with icy colors of white, pink, grey and cool taupe. Each piece is sprinkled with glitter creating a magical effect. \"As an artist my job is to invent. After a year of sketching and conceptualizing I created this new collection. It's a nostalgic collection of figural giftware and trim full of warmth, whimsy and magic. It combines the simple elegance of bisque porcelain with glitter, shiny mica and tinsel. I love the results and I hope that collectors will, too!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AhfszsDEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00AXQX1HU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXQX1HU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXQX1HU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":990675,"name":"Double-Sided Cutting Board for Kitchen, WELLSTAR Chopping Board with 304 Stainless Steel and Plastic for Meat Vegetable Fruit, Non-Slip Easy Clean Lar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710TPkCs0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DOUBLE-SIDED CHOPPING BOARD】One side of the cutting board is made of food grade 304 stainless steel, you can cut raw meat/fish and knead the dough on this side, another side is made of BPA free polypropylene (pp) plastic infused with wheat straw fiber, you can cut fruits and vegetables on this side, the surrounding juice-grooves help catch juices from overflowing 【SAFE, ANTI-SLIDE DESIGN】The trim around the board with soft rubber and the four raised cushions on each side make the board non-slip and non-slide when cutting. Our large multi-function cutting board stays flat and firmly on your countertop, you don’t need to put a wet paper towel underneath it in order to help it from turning and worry about the board’s moving around. It’s safe for you now while cutting 【HEALTHY, HYGIENIC】For the 304 stainless steel side, it is very easy clean and use without odor, does not leave stains or odors. Unlike the bamboo or other wooden cutting board, there is no crack, no mold and no warp after long time use for our cutting board. It’s very healthy and hygienic for you to prepare your delicious meals, especially great for preparing your baby or toddler’s food 【DURABLE, EASY TO GRIP】Our non-slip dual-sided chopping board measures 15.75 x 10.65 x 0.55 inch and weighs 3.45 lbs, and painstakingly combined with three different materials of wheat straw infused pp, easy cleaning top grade stainless steel and comfortable non-skid rubber (TPR), these ensure our carving board very durable for long-life span. Beveled border edges design and handle hanging hole make it easy to grip, you can easily take it from the countertop 【CUSTOMER GUARANTEE-100% SATISFACTION】Lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects. For any question, we will provide you the satisfied solution. This makes your purchase absolutely risk-free and you can enjoy testing our quality and durability. Purchase this dual-sided reversible chopping board today while stocks last by clicking \"Add to Cart\" above","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710TPkCs0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELLSTAR","source_asin":"B0872R1FW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0872R1FW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0872R1FW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
