window.products.push({"id":990773,"name":"Bkyedsa Fall Thanksgiving Plaid Decoration Tablecloth Rectangle Table Cover Perfect for Autumn Harvest Festival Party Kitchen Dinner Table Topper, 60”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KDOW4xo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Material: Our fall tablecloths are made of environmentally friendly polyester, the fabric is soft and comfortable, durable and not easy to damage, suitable for machine wash or hand wash, which is a very suitable material for long-term home use. AUTUMN DESIGN: This Fall Thanksgiving decorative tablecloth are inspired by autumn harvest scenes. A classic beige background and a double border of turkeys, pumpkins and persimmon tree with autumn maple leaf floating in the middle areas that create a flashy autumn feeling. The exquisite design can definetly make your family members and friends be marvel！ About Size: The size of this Thanksgiving tablecloth is 60x102 inch, suitable for fall decorations of a table for 6-8 people, suitable for daily use at home, and the exquisite design accompany you to spend every wonderful dining time. Perfect Table Protection: Our fall rectangle tablecloth can protect your table from scratches, stains. Our holiday tablecloths are easier to clean than most scrims. Stands up to repeated use and frequent washing, making it the perfect table protector for both indoor and outdoor dining tables. Multipurpose: Fully decorate your home. This fall plaid tablecloth is perfect for all types of fall arrangements and occasions, such as fall themed parties, dinner parties, camping, festivals, gatherings of friends, family reunions, Thanksgiving and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KDOW4xo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bkyedsa","source_asin":"B0C2CHBN9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CHBN9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CHBN9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":990774,"name":"Lake Tahoe, California - Riding, Boating, Swimming, Fishing, Hiking, Golf - Vintage Travel Poster by Kerne Erickson - Master Art Print 9in x 12in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kkvgtLxPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a taste of Aloha with these beautiful Master Art Prints by Pacifica Island Art - printed in Maui, Hawaii. This print will look wonderful framed in the home, office or restaurant and is perfect for the Vintage Art Collector. - ABOUT THE ARTIST - Kerne Erickson - For over 30 years, award-winning artist Kerne Erickson’s retro-style travel posters have been taking viewers ‘on location’ to popular destinations around the globe. Inspired by vintage vacation photos, brochures and other graphics, his depictions are painstakingly researched and meticulously depicted for historical accuracy as well as irresistible nostalgia. At a time when sterile, computer-generated art has become popular, it’s refreshing to see an artist like Kerne who can work his way from a well composed pencil drawing, through transparent layers of under painting, building depth and tonality until finally adding the finishing touches that bring the work into focus. His work is a perfect blend of traditional technique and modern painting mediums. Erickson, a graduate of Los Angeles Art Center College, worked for years as a freelance graphic artist on client commissions which served to develop his distinctive style. He is now a freelance artist working at his home in Orange County, California where he lives with his family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kkvgtLxPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacifica Island Art","source_asin":"B01M4P7S5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M4P7S5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M4P7S5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
