window.products.push({"id":990780,"name":"Locomocean, Black A5 Cinematic Marquee LED Lightbox with Built-in Tile Storage Includes 90 Alphanumeric Characters and 10 Colorized Emoji","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-1A+xjNWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say it all, at home or on-the-go with Locomocean’s A5 Cinematic Lightbox It’s important to create and express individuality, which is where Locomocean comes in to help. Add some trendy retro flair to any room quickly and easily with this unique cinema lightbox. Built to last, we use a high-quality, light-weight ABS shell to create the box, offering crucial durability for the life of your lightbox. The classic black casing offers chic contrast with the LED illuminated background, so any messages, quotes, fun notes, phrases, or reminders can be seen with ease. Easily personalize your heart out by sliding the tiles in and out of rows, and then pop in your favorite emoji for an extra splash of color and fun! The included tiles slide into the lightbox rows, and each row can fit up to 8 characters at a time to help you create and express yourself with 90 numbers and letters – plus 10 emoji tiles! Never worry about losing a letter or finding additional storage. Our lightbox comes with ultra-convenient, built-in storage for up to 180 tiles, so you never have to worry about keeping your accessories together. Stoppers are built in to prevent any tiles from falling out. Uniquely designed to fit your life, this A5 lightbox can fit wherever you need to be heard. The small-scale nostalgic design is a great accent piece, and the perfect size for gifting for birthdays, office parties, gift exchanges, wedding and baby showers, and holidays!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-1A+xjNWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Locomocean","source_asin":"B01DKTEMDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-990780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DKTEMDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DKTEMDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
